# 42. Cost accounting must be first-class

Every action receives:

```text
estimated_cost
actual_cost
```

For free quota:

```text
actual_cost = 0
economic_cost = provider-normalized shadow price
```

Why keep both?

Because otherwise Cogym learns:

> free temporary quota = universally optimal architecture.

Store:

```text
cash_cost
normalized_cost
```

This lets experiments ask either:

```text
